  "contracts": {"color": "straight scene-linear interpolation through a sorted table of 1 to 64 stops (Linear, Constant, Ease, Cardinal, B-Spline or Exponential in RGB; HSV or HSL with a Near, Far, Clockwise or Counter-clockwise hue), held outside the first and last except the spline modes; premultiplied RGBA32F output", "repeat": "clamp/repeat/mirror", "geometry": "physical pixel aspect, pixel-centre sampling; O(1) binary64 normalized origin/steps split into compensated Float32 pairs for production linear projection and radial norm; phase reduction retains the low component"}
